The Thieves' Guild is as old as the world of the Sphere itself. Although for success in the guild ambitious
Thieves require both a high title and a degree, however they do not
they are interested in pure elemental magic, preferring alchemy, which is more useful
for their craft. Success in the field of theft does not contribute to endurance,
but the dexterity and accuracy of Thieves remain unsurpassed. The secret skills of the Guild -
the envy of many, because Thieves have grasped the secret of invisibility without
no magic rings or amulets.
